id: pmc-mwnu
title: Keep installed usage documentation links portable and the dependency-updates table row valid
description: "GitHub issue unbraind/pm-changelog#219. docs/usage.md linked pmc-3jq8 and pmc-j6cb through relative paths into this repository's tracker, which resolve into the consumer's tracker once the docs are installed under the consumer's extensions directory. The dependency-updates options-table row contained an unescaped pipe inside inline code, which GFM splits into a fourth cell. Both are now enforced by test/shipped-docs.test.ts across every shipped Markdown file."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 3
tags[2]: docs,packaging
created_at: "2026-10-04T16:34:11.263Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-04T16:50:52.603Z"
deadline: "2026-10-06T00:00:00.000Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-04T16:50:52.000Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-04T16:50:52.000Z"
author: claude-orchestrator
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: every relative link in shipped Markdown resolves to a shipped file; the two tracker links are absolute GitHub URLs that return 200; every shipped table row has its header's column count; test/shipped-docs.test.ts failed before the doc fix and passes after
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-04T16:34:11.263Z",claude-orchestrator,"TDD: shipped-docs.test.ts failed first with docs/usage.md -> .agents/pm/issues/pmc-3jq8.toon and pmc-j6cb.toon and docs/usage.md:333 has 4 cells vs header 3; after the doc fix both pass. Absolute links return HTTP 200. release:check passes (529 tests)."
  "2026-10-04T16:46:42.710Z",claude-orchestrator,"Review round 1 (Greptile P2 x2, CodeRabbit x2): links and tables are now located with the marked GFM lexer (inline, titled, reference-style links, images; tables with or without outer pipes), shipped Markdown is discovered under every shipped directory, and fixture tests prove each form is flagged. Revert check: with origin/main docs/usage.md the shipped-link test fails on both tracker links. marked 18.0.14 added as an exact devDependency."
files[2]{path,scope,note}:
  docs/usage.md,project,link and table fix
  test/shipped-docs.test.ts,project,shipped Markdown contract
tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  node --test test/shipped-docs.test.ts,project,60,claude-orchestrator,"2026-10-04T16:34:11.263Z",local_mutation,docs/portable-usage-links-and-valid-deps-table
docs[1]{path,scope}:
  docs/usage.md,project
close_reason: "Fixed in PR #222: absolute tracker links (HTTP 200), escaped table pipe, test/shipped-docs.test.ts (marked GFM lexer; fixtures for inline/titled/reference links, images, pipe-less tables; revert check fails on origin/main docs). release:check 532 pass. Greptile 5/5 on b878065; CodeRabbit verified both fixes in-thread; all review threads resolved."
body: "Fix in docs/usage.md plus a contract test over every shipped Markdown file (package.json files allow-list): relative links must resolve to shipped files, table rows must keep their header's cell count."
